#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:5
#: 1332c247b742446ea17097430267f8d5
msgid "Archived:Loading ChibiOS firmware onto Pixhawk"
msgstr "归档：将 ChibiOS 固件烧录到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:9
#: 8f66eb91b2dd462793976694ca1d15e7
msgid ""
"These instructions explain how to download and install the beta ArduPilot "
"with ChibiOS firmware onto a pixhawk autopilot."
msgstr "这些说明介绍了如何下载并将带有 ChibiOS 固件的 ArduPilot 测试版安装到 Pixhawk 飞控上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:11
#: fa84b866711744cbaa5150f6a99d7d58
msgid ""
"In tests the development team has found using ChibiOS (in place of NuttX) "
"results in a smaller firmware with faster loop rates and less timing jitter."
" ChibiOS builds have less testing and a few `missing features "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/8109>`__ however."
msgstr ""
"测试中，开发团队发现使用 ChibiOS（代替 NuttX）可获得更小的固件、更快的循环速率和更小的时序抖动。然而，ChibiOS "
"构建的测试较少，也有一些 `缺失功能 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/8109>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:14
#: 1be52e1d1d004bfb99788f8d194a5fba
msgid ""
"Parameters are preserved when moving between ChibiOS and NuttX firmwares and"
" no re-tuning of the vehicle should be required."
msgstr "在 ChibiOS 和 NuttX 固件之间切换时，参数会被保留，无需重新调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:17
#: cff35b2938054946b862deb7560dedd0
