#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:31
#: 554b4f7faf5346fcbeb4f8edc726f83d
msgid "Uploading as Custom Firmware"
msgstr "作为自定义固件上传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:33
#: 9514f896741c4f9fb2f5dc101b40af27
msgid "connect the ground station PC to the autopilot using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线缆将地面站电脑连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:34
#: 53e3b5fb1f6c4f04b475322857a6f33e
msgid ""
"select the COM port and baud rate (normally 115200) for the board.  If using"
" the Mission Planner these are selected on the top right of the screen.  Do "
"**not** press the Connect button"
msgstr ""
"选择飞控板的 COM 端口和波特率（通常为 115200）。如果使用 Mission Planner，这些在屏幕右上角选择。**不要**按 "
"Connect 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:35
#: 8261625d321e486a9a09c70eca0959c9
msgid ""
"go to the GCS's firmware install screen.  If using the Mission Planner "
"select \"Initial Setup >> Install Firmware\""
msgstr "进入 GCS 的固件安装界面。如果使用 Mission Planner，选择 「初始设置 >> 安装固件」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:36
#: aa84f7cd7536487c8853c3f98232fd84
msgid ""
"click the \"Load custom firmware\" link and select the .apj file downloaded "
"above.  If using the Mission Planner and the \"Load custom firmware\" link "
"is not visible select \"Config/Tuning >> Planner\" and set the \"Layout\" "
"drop-down to \"Advanced\"."
msgstr ""
"点击 「加载自定义固件」 链接并选择上方下载的 .apj 文件。如果使用 Mission Planner 但 「加载自定义固件」 链接不可见，请选择 "
"「配置/调参 >> 规划器」，将 「布局」 下拉菜单设为 「高级」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:42
#: 942219babffa4345acf33332417552c2
msgid ""
"following any instructions displayed regarding plugging/unplugging the board"
msgstr "按照屏幕上显示的关于插拔飞控板的任何说明操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:43
#: e22284fc5a744728ad46c1c896875f75
msgid ""
"if all goes well some status should be displayed at the bottom of the "
"screen.  i.e. \"erase...\", \"program...\", \"verify..\" and \"Upload "
"Done\"."
msgstr ""
"如果一切顺利，屏幕底部会显示一些状态信息，如 「erase...」、「program...」、「verify..」 和 「Upload Done」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:46
#: d38abb7f06834757851035c8fc7f30ed
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:48
#: 7566c09452764935b3b30cd0d1253042
msgid "open the ground stations's flight data screen"
msgstr "打开地面站的飞行数据界面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:49
#: 1aa1bf5945294c068bbe8aa10b71b76d
msgid ""
"select the COM port (which will have changed compared to the NuttX versions)"
" and baud (normally 115200)"
msgstr "选择 COM 端口（与 NuttX 版本相比会有变化）和波特率（通常为 115200）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:50
#: 5fadb3baa6944a858cf57c3c653c84a2
msgid "press the **Connect** button"
msgstr "按 **Connect** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:51
#: 17a45c4178984278bd1dcaf86ba31079
msgid ""
"after parameters are downloaded, the HUD should update as you tilt the board"
msgstr "参数下载完成后，倾斜飞控板时 HUD 应随之更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-loading-chibios-firmware-onto-pixhawk.rst:53
#: 56a9b54029e54aea9fb6ec29184b87d0
msgid ""
"More details on connecting a GCS to the autopilot are described :ref:`here "
"<common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot>`."
msgstr ""
"关于将 GCS 连接到飞控的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-connect-mission-planner-autopilot>`。"
